  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Au café, Clara lit la carte des boissons.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄົນຂາຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເອົາຫຍັງເອື້ອຍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Ǎo nyǎng ʉ̂ay?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂໍກາເຟໜຶ່ງຈອກ</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̌ɔ kǎa-féé nʉ̀ng jɔ̏ɔk.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄົນຂາຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຮ້ອນຫຼືເຢັນ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Hȍɔn lʉ̌ʉ yěn?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເຢັນ ບໍ່ຫວານຫຼາຍເດີ</span><span class=\"rom\">Yěn. Bɔ̀ɔ wǎan lǎay dɤ̌ɤ.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄົນຂາຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄດ້ເຈົ້າ</span><span class=\"rom\">Dâay jâo.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂອບໃຈ</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>La vendeuse</b> — Qu&#x27;est-ce que tu prends ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Un café, s&#x27;il vous plaît.<br><b>La vendeuse</b> — Chaud ou glacé ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Glacé. Pas trop sucré, hein.<br><b>La vendeuse</b> — D&#x27;accord.<br><b>Clara</b> — Merci.</p></details>"
